# Repo setup user prompt - August 28, 2026

In the diary_entries folder, over time, create a record of work I do with the LLM. Here are some initial guidelines to follow:

## Files

Each day, create a new file markdown file with a file name that follows the following pattern (as an example) "08-28-2026_02-30-45pm". 

The topmost heading of these daily files (when we have work to record) will be be "Entries - August 28, 2026" (as an example of the pattern). 

The daily file will contain multiple entries regarding the work I did with the LLM. 

## Entries

After a period of interactions, I will instruct the LLM to record an entry describing the work done, e.g., what the LLM did, what problems the LLM encountered, what the LLM will do differently next time.

Each entry will be titled with the date and time of the entry, following this pattern: "August 28, 2026 - 10:40am - [append name of LLM used]".